' Notes for the boundary classes (class-model.iuml).
package boundary {
  note right of GameCLI
    <b>Boundary only</b>
    GameCLI shows numbered menus, asks again on malformed
    input and skips '#' lines in scripted runs. Whether a
    move is legal is decided by the entity classes; GameCLI
    only asks them (e.g. the read-only Restaurant.canSeat()).
  end note
}
